\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  God's Love is great
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and let us give him praise,
\par His love in abundance;
\par All men on earth
\par are rot, due to our sins,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par but He embraces us
\par His only begotten son, he gave
\par to us to free us from deaths bondage
\par His love is great.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  He loves us much
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj  so then do let us look
\par  for  everlasting peace.
\par You sons of God
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Christ Jesus calls you all
\par to come to him today.
\par list to His call and do follow Him
\par and give yourself  to Christ Jesus now
\par and be get saved.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.  Who so-ever,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  listen to this grace call
\par  shall never be condemned.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He will be saved
\par   from condemnation now
\par   and everlasting hell
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  to life, and will not have no turn back.
\par  He will be glad with Jesus always
\par  and be sober.
\par \pard\fi360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.   O Jesus Christ
\par \pard\fi360\sl190\slmult0\qj  You have revealed to me
\par  Such great and perfect love
\par  My Saviour dear,
\par  let everything in me
\par \pard\fi360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\fi360\sl190\slmult0\qj  burn on this everyday
\par  Your suffering and your pains on the cross,
\par  And your death that saved me from my sins
\par  I'll keep in mind.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

